In this scrum cycle Im going to implement Ai professor summaries. The summaries will be generated using the reviews under a professor. 
It will regenerate after n number of new reviews created, so that it doesn't call the api multiple times. I will also gather a one word 
description to describe the professor and it will list the common complaints found in the reviews. 

I was able to implement this using Groq which I found to be good at summarizing the reviews. when summaries are generated they are also saved in the 
database. The api only gets called every 10 new reviews. I did this so the api wouldn't get hit all the time a new review is created. I also did 10 
new reviews because if it would keep the summary updated to match the reviews. When the user is trying to view professors summary, it would grab the
saved summary if there isn't any new reviews. 
